"data_color":"","number1_name":"","number1_des":"","number2_name":"","number2_des":"","show_online_display":false,"icon_size":48,"text_type_scale":"medium","icon_position":"above","mobile_stack":false,"show_all_on_mobile":true,"section_height":"medium","bg":"#f9f9f9","text_color":"","color_scheme":"1","full_width":true,"dividers":"none","prevent_animation":false}},"faq_tcPUPr":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"category_YbEL79":{"type":"category","settings":{"text":"Product","text_id":""}},"question_Ry3VKX":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Can I customize the shell color of the MESA series?","text":"<p>We currently do not support customized Mesa Series Shell colors, however we have a selection of 5 colors to choose from: Green, Blue, Red, Black, and Stainless Steel.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_HdTpHB":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Which grills can be converted to natural gas?","text":"<p>This grill 41847NG and D605 can be converted to natural gas with the purchase of Monument Grills Conversion Kit model 98523 (Sold Separately). You can click here to buy the conversion kit.<\/p><p>The link: https:\/\/monumentgrills.com\/products\/natural-gas-conversion-kit<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_PbBJKM":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What is the glass window made of?","text":"<p>Our glass window are made of high temperature resistant silicone compounds.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_JDEbNU":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"How much weight can the side tables on my grill hold?","text":"<p>The shelf is designed to hold plates of food to be cooked, spices, sauces, beverages, etc. It should not be used to hold excessive weight. The Denali grill shelves can hold up to 45lbs and the rest of the grill shelves can hold up to 20lbs.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_mYRfhC":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"How should I preheating?","text":"<p>Ensuring proper preheating of the grill is crucial for achieving the desired high temperature. Begin by lighting the grill following the instructions in your owner's manual. Then, turn up the burners, cover the grill with the lid, and wait approximately 15 minutes.<\/p><p>After this time, the grill should reach a temperature between 500 and 550 degrees Fahrenheit. Properly preheating your grill is also essential for preventing food from sticking to the cooking grates.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_bj67kc":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Will my tabletop gas grill have a suitable rain cover?","text":"<p>Yes, we have rain cover for portable gas grill, you need to buy them separately on the website.<\/p><p>The link: https:\/\/monumentgrills.com\/products\/gas-and-charcoal-grill-cover?variant=39833209077823<\/p><p>The link: https:\/\/monumentgrills.com\/products\/gas-and-charcoal-grill-cover?variant=39833181618239<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_XKqxxp":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Does the tabletop grill come with a propane hose?","text":"<p>The grill includes a hose to connect to 20lb Propane Tank.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_Wybn9k":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What is a broil zone?​","text":"<p>The MESA's main sear zone consists of three burners that are positioned closer together than the other burners on the grill. This creates an area on the grill that heats up more quickly and reaches higher temperatures than other areas, allowing for rapid heating. You can cook your steaks, ribs, and other foods to perfection in this zone.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_aaQwKh":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Are there stainless steel grates for the Mesa series?","text":"<p>We currently do not have stainless steel cooking grates for our MESA Series, however we do have a plan for releasing them in the future.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_w48J4k":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What is the maximum temperature of the MESA?","text":"<p>The maximum temperature of the grill may vary slightly depending on the ambient temperature and the way of use, we give the reference value of the maximum temperature, M200S、M220、M200B、M200G、M200R、M305、M325: 650℉<br\/>M405、M425：680℉<br\/>M415BZ：750℉<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_8gF9Pw":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Can all four wheels of the MESA be turned?","text":"<p>Yes, for ease of mobility, we have equipped the MESA series with four steerable wheels.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_bLWfCW":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What is the size of my shelf?","text":"<p>The area of a single shelf in our Mesa series can reach 227 sqin<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_VkAmyx":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Can I build my Mesa in?","text":"<p>The Mesa grill  can not be used as a built in grill for an ourdoor\/indoor kitchen as there dangers in reforming a freestanding grill.<\/p>","read_number":0}}},"block_order":["category_YbEL79","question_Ry3VKX","question_HdTpHB","question_PbBJKM","question_JDEbNU","question_mYRfhC","question_bj67kc","question_XKqxxp","question_Wybn9k","question_aaQwKh","question_w48J4k","question_8gF9Pw","question_bLWfCW","question_VkAmyx"],"settings":{"heading":"FAQ","heading_align":"text-center","color_scheme":"none","full_width":true}},"1709290681b16acc24":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"yotpo_product_reviews_ugc_reviews_pQ3UFC":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/reviews\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}}},"block_order":["yotpo_product_reviews_ugc_reviews_pQ3UFC"],"settings":{"link_id":"","full_width":false}}},"order":["main","rich_text_GPJtyQ","image_banner_fzj3Wf","icons_with_text_cc9MeK","background_video_pXLHp7","details","product_features_list_8wARwt","multi_column_ycYQ3q","multi_column_dqpJAH","device_dot_qamAYx","multi_colu